Package: ciforge-agent
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: CloudImageForge Contributors <cloudimageforge@example.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), liblocalfoo1
Description: Demonstrates a host-only apt dependency
 liblocalfoo1 is installed on the developer workstation but is not in
 the Ubuntu Archive, so apt resolves on the host and fails on a clean
 jammy/noble cloud image. See README "Staging fallback check".
